        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: The Watercolor, Mary and Max\n- People: Adam Elliot, Dale Cornelius, Melanie Coombs\n- Companies: Melodrama Pictures, Icon Entertainment International\n- Topics: release dates, production, reception, box office\n\nFacts:\n- Mary and Max is a 2009 Australian stop motion animated comedy-drama film written and directed by Adam Elliot as his first animated feature film.\n- Mary and Max features music by Dale Cornelius and was produced by Melanie Coombs and Melodrama Pictures.\n- Mary and Max was theatrically released on April 9, 2009 by Icon Entertainment International.\n- The Watercolor went on nationwide general release on November 13, 2009.\n- Mary and Max received very positive reviews from critics.\n- Mary and Max earned $1.7 million USD on a budget of $8.2 million AUD.",
